@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Identify parts;
:Need to elicit information from customer;
:v1: Need to elicit information from customer ({Yes, Already have availability information}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = 'Yes'])
:Check availability of parts;
else ([v1 = 'Already have availability information'])
:Proceed with process;
endif
:Are parts supplied to customer;
:v2: Are parts supplied to customer ({Yes, Need to record customer details}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v2 = 'Need to record customer details'])
:Record customer details;
:Order and receive part from Disuki;
else ([v2 = 'Yes'])
:Continue with the process;
endif
:Contract customer;
:Proceed with payment;
:End;
stop
@enduml